### 1. Testar cadastro de funcionario
POST http://localhost:3000/funcionario
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nome": "Roberto",
    "email": "roberto@gmail.com",
    "senha": "abc",
    "cpf": "12345678912",
    "endereco": "rua abc, 5",
    "celular": "47912345678"
}

### 5. Fazer Login do ciclista (Armazena o token automaticamente)
# @name loginReq
POST http://localhost:3000/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "roberto@gmail.com",
    "senha": "abc"
}


### 1. Testar cadastro de motorista
POST http://localhost:3000/motorista
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}


{
    "nome": "Santiago",
    "cnh": "123",
    "cpf": "12345678912",
    "telefone": "47912345678"
}

